          "issue": "The main rendering defensibly attaches αἰδίῳ to πυρί across the intervening verb, but the notes do not disclose its possible attachment to αἰῶνι. That alternative locates the explicit qualification “eternal” on the coming age rather than on the fire, a material distinction concerning the punishment language.",
